say|KUSAKAM|That old man... He's such a fool.
say|KUSAKAM|Why can't I become a shaman right now?
say|KUSAKAM|I don't get what's holding me back.
say|KUSAKAM|Maybe the spirits of silence just favor me?
say|KUSAKAM|Silence... It's a spirit of the desert too.
say|KUSAKAM|Maybe it's the one that will teach me the shaman's way.
say|KUSAKAM|But for now I'm here, at the start of my path.
exit|
